<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1353381404"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1454477905"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="AIAIAI"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Kizuna AI / 中田ヤスタカ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="AIAIAI"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:05.059"><div begin="00:01.447" end="03:05.059"><p begin="00:01.447" end="00:05.300" itunes:key="L1">ちゅめて　ちゅめて　飛び切り以外<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啾咪 啾咪 除了格外优秀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo ku ： na ka da ya su ta ka</span></p><p begin="00:05.310" end="00:08.991" itunes:key="L2">いやだ　いやだのなの風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是讨厌 讨厌的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya da i ya da no na no fu u</span></p><p begin="00:09.001" end="00:12.679" itunes:key="L3">全て夢で　ものすごく濃い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有一切 都带着浓郁的梦想气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te yu me de mo no su go ku ko i</span></p><p begin="00:12.689" end="00:15.969" itunes:key="L4">ぴとり　ぴとりってたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想 好想能够独处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi to ri pi to ri 't te ta i</span></p><p begin="00:25.400" end="00:26.474" itunes:key="L5">せーのっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预——备！</span></p><p begin="00:26.484" end="00:28.380" itunes:key="L6">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="00:28.390" end="00:30.349" itunes:key="L7">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="00:34.085" end="00:37.133" itunes:key="L8">響くクラップ　奏でるメロり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回响的掌声 奏响的旋律</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi ku ku ra 'p pu ka na de me ro ri</span></p><p begin="00:37.143" end="00:41.565" itunes:key="L9">なんで　なんで　理由なんてないっ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么 为什么 没有什么理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n de na n de ri yu u na n te na i '</span></p><p begin="00:41.575" end="00:44.598" itunes:key="L10">わちゃちゃちゃちゃちゃのお茶の間に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嬉笑打闹吵嚷不断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa cha cha cha cha cha no</span></p><p begin="00:44.608" end="00:48.851" itunes:key="L11">投げて　投げて　ほら　いたずらちゅう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">的茶歇期间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ge te na ge te</span></p><p begin="00:48.861" end="00:52.539" itunes:key="L12">もうちょっとちょっとちょっとできるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还能再惹是生非一些</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u cho to cho to cho to de ki ru no</span></p><p begin="00:52.549" end="00:56.341" itunes:key="L13">きょとちょと　しちゃうし ジャンピングでピュー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毛毛躁躁东奔西跑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo to kyo to shi cha u shi</span></p><p begin="00:56.351" end="01:02.889" itunes:key="L14">なみなみ注いで　愛なのよ　I know I know I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向你注入满满的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi na mi so so i de a i na no yo</span></p><p begin="01:03.395" end="01:07.202" itunes:key="L15">ちゅめて　ちゅめて　飛び切り以外<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啾咪 啾咪 除了格外优秀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu me te chu me te to bi ki ri i ga i</span></p><p begin="01:07.212" end="01:10.868" itunes:key="L16">いやだ　いやだのなの風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是讨厌 讨厌的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya da i ya da no na no fu u</span></p><p begin="01:10.878" end="01:14.595" itunes:key="L17">全て夢で　ものすごく濃い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有一切 都带着浓郁的梦想气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te yu me de mo no su go ku ko i</span></p><p begin="01:14.605" end="01:17.895" itunes:key="L18">ぴとり　ぴとりってAI<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我 只有我是AI</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi to ri pi to ri 't te AI</span></p><p begin="01:17.905" end="01:18.975" itunes:key="L19">いくよっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要上咯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:18.985" end="01:20.934" itunes:key="L20">HO! HO! HO! HO!<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:20.944" end="01:22.823" itunes:key="L21">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="01:25.362" end="01:26.497" itunes:key="L22">せーのっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一二</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i no</span></p><p begin="01:26.507" end="01:28.353" itunes:key="L23">HO! HO! HO! HO!<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i no</span></p><p begin="01:28.363" end="01:30.275" itunes:key="L24">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="01:32.609" end="01:34.520" itunes:key="L25">あ　あい　あい　あい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 爱 爱 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a i a i a i</span></p><p begin="01:34.530" end="01:36.405" itunes:key="L26">ちゅ　ちゅめ　ちゅめ　ちゅめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（｡･ρ･）ﾁｭﾒﾃ</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu chu me chu me chu me</span></p><p begin="01:36.415" end="01:38.378" itunes:key="L27">あ　あい　あい　あい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 爱 爱 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a i a i a i</span></p><p begin="01:38.388" end="01:40.159" itunes:key="L28">キュ　キュめ　キュめ　キュめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">ｷｭﾒﾃ（･q･｡）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyu kyu me kyu me kyu me</span></p><p begin="01:40.169" end="01:42.004" itunes:key="L29">あ　あい　あい　あい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 爱 爱 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a i a i a i</span></p><p begin="01:42.014" end="01:43.957" itunes:key="L30">ちゅ　ちゅめ　ちゅめ　ちゅめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（｡･ρ･）ﾁｭﾒﾃ</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu chu me chu me chu me</span></p><p begin="01:43.967" end="01:45.784" itunes:key="L31">あ　あい　あい　あい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 爱 爱 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a i a i a i</span></p><p begin="01:45.794" end="01:48.414" itunes:key="L32">あ　あい　あい　あい　あい　あい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱 爱 爱 爱 爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a i a i a i a i a i</span></p><p begin="01:48.424" end="01:52.159" itunes:key="L33">キュめて　キュめて　他にはいない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心动 心动 再没有其他</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyu me te kyu me te ho ka ni wa i na i</span></p><p begin="01:52.169" end="01:55.853" itunes:key="L34">つよめ　つよめの期待<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">强烈 强烈地期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yo me tsu yo me no ki ta i</span></p><p begin="01:55.863" end="01:59.656" itunes:key="L35">増えり　増えり　吹き飛ばせない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">增多 增多 绝不会被吹飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu e ri fu e ri fu ki to ba se na i</span></p><p begin="01:59.666" end="02:02.263" itunes:key="L36">キミに　キミには未来<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向你 向你 献上未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni ki mi ni wa mi ra i</span></p><p begin="02:02.273" end="02:03.406" itunes:key="L37">手拍子<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu me te chu me te to bi ki ri i ga i</span></p><p begin="02:03.416" end="02:07.076" itunes:key="L38">ちゅめて　ちゅめて　飛び切り以外<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啾咪 啾咪 除了格外优秀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu me te chu me te to bi ki ri i ga i</span></p><p begin="02:07.086" end="02:10.809" itunes:key="L39">いやだ　いやだのなの風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是讨厌 讨厌的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya da i ya da no na no fu u</span></p><p begin="02:10.819" end="02:14.585" itunes:key="L40">全て夢で　ものすごく濃い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有一切 都带着浓郁的梦想气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te yu me de mo no su go ku ko i</span></p><p begin="02:14.595" end="02:18.552" itunes:key="L41">ぴとり　ぴとりってAI<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我 只有我是AI</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi to ri pi to ri 't te AI</span></p><p begin="02:19.780" end="02:20.816" itunes:key="L42">いくよっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要上咯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:20.826" end="02:22.828" itunes:key="L43">HO! HO! HO! HO!<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:22.838" end="02:24.649" itunes:key="L44">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="02:27.149" end="02:28.413" itunes:key="L45">もういっちょ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经可以了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i i da</span></p><p begin="02:28.423" end="02:30.181" itunes:key="L46">HO! HO! HO! HO!<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i i da</span></p><p begin="02:30.191" end="02:32.067" itunes:key="L47">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="02:33.724" end="02:35.986" itunes:key="L48">まだまだいくよ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还能继续哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ma da i ku yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.996" end="02:37.817" itunes:key="L49">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="02:37.827" end="02:39.697" itunes:key="L50">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="02:42.324" end="02:43.378" itunes:key="L51">せーのっ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一二</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i no</span></p><p begin="02:43.388" end="02:45.225" itunes:key="L52">HO! HO! HO! HO!<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se i no</span></p><p begin="02:45.235" end="02:47.222" itunes:key="L53">HO! HO! HO! HO!</p><p begin="02:50.316" end="02:54.013" itunes:key="L54">ちゅめて　ちゅめて　飛び切り以外<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啾咪 啾咪 除了格外优秀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chu me te chu me te to bi ki ri i ga i</span></p><p begin="02:54.023" end="02:57.737" itunes:key="L55">いやだ　いやだのなの風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都是讨厌 讨厌的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ya da i ya da no na no fu u</span></p><p begin="02:57.747" end="03:01.525" itunes:key="L56">全て夢で　ものすごく濃い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有一切 都带着浓郁的梦想气息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te yu me de mo no su go ku ko i</span></p><p begin="03:01.535" end="03:05.059" itunes:key="L57">ぴとり　ぴとりってたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想 好想能够独处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pi to ri pi to ri 't te ta i</span></p></div></body></tt>